flowchart LR
  H[installed moil as transitional root] --> K[Mois seed in the current subset]
  SEED[Committed SnBC seed - ADR-0009, proposed] --> RS[moil run-snbc only: seed compiles the sources]
  RS --> SFP[Seed chain fixed point]
  SFP --> DIFF[Differential: seed stage 1 equals moil build stage 1]
  C2 --> DIFF
  SFP --> NSEED[Native assembly seed - slice 2, pending]
  K --> C1[moil build: SnBC + bundled C VM]
  C1 --> C2[Seed compiles its sources to SnBC]
  C2 --> R[Current runtime executes SnBC]
  R --> FP[Compare successive SnBC images]
  C2 --> VM[Mois SnBC executor runs the compiler image]
  VM --> FP
  C2 --> NAT[Native backend N1+N2: program + Mois runtime to aarch64]
  NAT --> LS[libSystem boundary: write read open close mmap exit]
  NAT --> N3[N3: compiler compiled natively - pending]
  FP --> C3[Grow the subset in Mois]
  C3 --> C2
  C3 --> CN[Complete Mois compiler]
  CN --> SELF[Compiles its own sources]
  SELF --> DDC[DDC with an independent root]
